=== ADVERSARIAL: is this a quality win? NO; and n is small. ===
  MoE-minus-dense quality = +0.22 (confounded: different models) -> NOT the claim.
  Robust claim = EFFICIENCY at footprint: positive roofline residual + higher within-Granite
  tps/GB. CAVEATS: (1) only 2 small MoE models are reliably tagged (few exist; is_moe is
  under-populated and 'hybrid' != MoE, so uncertain labels are NOT forced) -> directional,
  underpowered. (2) Raw overall tps/GB is size-confounded (MoE store all params on disk);
  the size-controlled roofline residual is the correct metric.

